WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:13,250
Could it be that I ate too much shark meat during the day?

2
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,480
Why is this shark so meaty?

3
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,520
Why are you here now? What are you doing?

4
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,520
Everyone hasn't slept yet

5
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,420
Big iron head bow

6
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:35,330
I guess everyone won't be able to sleep for a while, so I'm leaving.

7
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:36,650
You tell her to go to bed early

8
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,050
Children don’t grow taller if they sleep late

9
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:45,360
Sany is better. The sharks are not big.

10
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:10,660
Uncle, what's going on?

11
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:13,580
This is because someone is jealous after seeing how many prawns we brought back yesterday.

12
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,260
So shall we go fishing for prawns today?

13
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:19,220
Of course we have to do it, but we have to think of a way to get rid of them first. How to get rid of them?

14
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,660
There are diesel wooden boats and iron boats behind

15
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:22,540
We can't outrun them. Just go away and I'll draw the boat.

16
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:25,940
Although the boat is rocking slowly,

17
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,260
But flexible and narrow

18
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:28,300
has its own advantages

19
00:01:33,410 --> 00:01:35,770
I, Zhang Jianguo, drifted at sea for decades in my last life

20
00:01:36,050 --> 00:01:38,850
He has the same attributes as the sea and his three ex-wives.

21
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:40,610
It's not that simple to want to be with me
